.TH Command TEND
.SY "tend <SHIP> <FROM-SHIP>"
The tend command allows your tender ships to resupply patrol boats,
submarines, battleships, etc. while at sea.
.s3
To tend ship #16 you could type:
.EX tend 16
You would then be asked the number of the tender providing the
goodies.
.s3
If the tender is in the same sector as the tendee, and
they're both yours, and so forth the program will ask how many military,
guns, etc. you want to transfer.  A negative value indicates
a transfer from the ship back to the tender.
.s3
For example:
.EX tend
.NF
Ship to be tended? 20
From tender #43
How many military (max 35, min -2)? 20
How many shells (max 25, min -5)? 10
How much food (max 15, min -55)? -25
.FI
.s3
See also : load, unload
